            "quote": "That\u2019s where my passion for coffee really took root. Once again, I found myself camping.",
            "reviewer_name": "Mt. McKinley",
            "reviewer_label": "Verified Reviewer",
            "product_name": "100Ah 12V LiFePO4 Deep Cycle Battery",
            "category": "RV"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "I\u2019ve got over 70 and have never had one of these batteries go bad",
            "reviewer_name": "Rick Harrison",
            "reviewer_label": "Verified Reviewer",
            "product_name": "100Ah 12V LiFePO4 Deep Cycle Battery",
            "category": "RV"
          }
